      "directory": "HostedStudents.tsx, HostedStudentEditor.tsx and HostedDirectoryControls.tsx extend the existing workspace. Native pickers use explicit theme surface/text roles, a one-unit border, radius 10, minimum height 52 and an 8-unit label gap. Forms and recovery states reuse existing Field, Button, Notice and RecordValue patterns.",
      "verification": "2026-10-23: 11 fictional Chromium directory workflows/views passed at 390/320, including dark picker recapture; no document overflow or application page errors. Intercepted fictional writes only. Native Android review and hosted actions remain unverified.",
      "native": "2026-10-23: API36 GraphiScan_Pixel_6 with Expo Go58.0.5 rendered login in light/dark and at dark font_scale1.3. Android KeyboardAvoidingView height behavior fixes reproduced covered login actions; actual IME recapture confirms password/sign-in above the keyboard. Font-scale configuration reload produced an expo-modules-core EventEmitter startup failure; fresh process recovered, underlying cause remains unverified. Other native role/form screens and physical device/APK remain open.",
      "logoutLoading": "2026-10-23: SignOutAction confirms manual logout across profiles/onboarding/student recovery, with Cancel/Escape/Android Back dismissal and forced-expiry bypass. Feed skeletons extend to choice/field/image/heading and hosted/legacy initial data loads. Scope-bound records retain refresh content. 14 fictional browser cases passed including dark320, reduced motion, Cancel/Escape, pending draft retention and exactly-once confirmation. Native modal/Back remains unverified; Android export1296 modules passed."
    }
